                <l xml:id="m-62dc3663-9b82-487b-8186-d59dfd641e4d" facs="#m-fbc31c64-da1e-4e39-81a5-2ae69822ba02" label="ambiguous">Corpus Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-b5cb48f4-1814-436e-810e-e9c874d83afd" facs="#m-2f2487dd-7e95-436d-9a48-7448931381a7" label="ambiguous">956</l><l xml:id="m-2a9eecce-2d5a-4662-9aa4-b591a4b681f3" facs="#m-84a7e2f1-355f-4273-8f76-96d4cd3afcec" label="lyrics-like">V. Et vínum laetí-ficet cor hómi-nis. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-4f50bdaa-417c-4a00-a1f4-8aa722b8eee7" facs="#m-7cbd1578-64bd-4a11-9308-cb2dcb1aede2" label="lyrics-like">V. Pósuit fines túos pácem, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-13e3391d-b9e0-4430-bbb5-ce88c28969e1" facs="#m-9ccd5008-9bbc-4b05-93e7-d566d3762d87" label="lyrics-like">R. Et ádipe fruménti sátiat te, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-1b3947ff-92be-4e5b-b17b-ecc60d2828d1" facs="#m-ca30e02d-de0d-40bd-a6a2-0d44078b4219" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-17005dc9-c9e7-4ae1-ba00-62d304f5820f" facs="#m-67aca39a-9b4e-4815-bc73-79a8e74a18dd" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 1. f. p. 128. — 2. Confitébor. 2. D. p. 134.</l><l xml:id="m-a5a438da-b431-4a58-b19a-c1ec692a56fb" facs="#m-d10caeb1-dc9d-45c4-8752-3c7755162cbc" label="lyrics-like">— 3. Crédidi. 3. a 2 p. 168. — 4. Beáti ómnes. 4. E. p. 177. — S. Láuda</l><l xml:id="m-cd01590a-f1b3-4aa9-9144-0c039db19a8a" facs="#m-0b17fbae-d86d-4920-87e7-fe1cf2f01bd9" label="lyrics-like">Jerúsalem. s. a. 205.</l><l xml:id="m-3d4eb73e-6eab-43f1-a252-d985eca593c0" facs="#m-18df7ae1-46db-4f2a-91a5-a5a652545a9f" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-9ad1cbe8-d6ee-4aa4-bd38-e74ed610550b" facs="#m-95ac8884-6529-4b40-804b-862b1dd11c24" label="ambiguous">1.r</l><l xml:id="m-fda4be22-a18b-4bb4-99c0-fa998171c9fb" facs="#m-16efe2b4-3e79-4d20-b34c-5b33770776c9" label="lyrics-like">Acérdos in aetérnum“ Chrístus Dóminus secún¬</l><l xml:id="m-800d2ee9-6410-427d-a9ec-6e9096ef9d73" facs="#m-607c31b9-9dac-4622-ba6d-4246c5cc6bbf" label="lyrics-like">dum ó